37. Running Total Per Group 
---------------------------


Business Question

The management wants to track cumulative revenue performance of each staff member over time.

For each staff member and month:

Calculate monthly revenue.
Calculate the running total revenue earned up to that month.
Display results in chronological order.

select
	staff_id,
	date_trunc('month', payment_date) as month,
	sum(amount) as revenue,
	
	sum(sum(amount)) over (
		partition by staff_id
		order by date_trunc('month', payment_date)
		rows between
			unbounded preceding
			and current row
	) as running_total_revenue
	
from payment
group by
	staff_id,
	date_trunc('month', payment_date)

order by
	staff_id, 
	month;





